# Public80 successor-v2 complete binding handoff

READY FOR ROOT AND PEER BINDING REVIEW; NOT ACTIVATED.

Candidate c83f352f057c64917f219eb938f54aa42cdab829,292 build inputs, full950 package
SHA2564671ed60875c87f8cc32b735fde5d9b57301f427ecd5a376ad1123afb951e156.
Baseline79 plus only git80 authority and accepted M1B composition are retained by
INPUT-BINDINGS.json, not reauthenticated by another product/archive run.
Fixture-v2 is2764c0541ebe1a517965bdc73f33b1651cb15935. Original three module-only
root-export assertion failures remain unchanged.

run.mjs assembles repair seal3a191d40be1e7da93f9ce1947050411a5f0278e92a47ce362ab95a2e740dcb7d.
The only additional runner predicate change is exact negative type diagnostics
plus nonzero rejection instead of assuming CLI exit2. Diagnostic count/codes/lines,
positive success, declaration hashes and physical layout binding remain required;
no emitSkipped assumption. SOURCE-RECONCILIATION.json records17 assembly checks.
No product, build, install, compiler, loader, RegexWorker, native oracle or private
execution occurred in this phase. Existing authentication/control receipts were
bound, not rerun.

COHORTS.json fixes each of source-built,installed,physically-moved:45public,
28apply,140versioned-M1A,93pack,12arrays,18coherence,12novel. Six type groups,
83maintained body cases,21moved stream cases,3mutants/3restores/3binding refusals
remain planned, all UNRUN here. Exact assertions/fixture hashes remain in EXECUTOR.
No old79/83, module139/140, or actual-v1 rescore. Names/node/npm/npx policies unchanged.

EXECUTION-SEAL.json binds shipping files, receipts, tools, sole prospective command
and future unused sibling actual-v2 output. ROOT-AUTHORIZATION-TEMPLATE.json is not
usable authorization. No actual directory is created by preparation; launcher uses
exclusive creation before any child admission and captures startup before child
spawn. Prior captures remain immutable. A new root receipt and peer disposition
are the remaining activation barriers, not an automatic retry permission.

ADMISSION.md defines exact loader/options/application policy and source-qualified
observability. CENSUS.json separates proposed32 internal admissions from32 Regex
Workers and the all-process128/peak4 budget, including owner/admin reserve.
CONTROL-COVERAGE-MAP.json is the author-facing handoff for Plato: original eight
failed identities stay failed, related coverage and P09 configuration gap explicit.

Future sole command (DO NOT RUN in this phase):

```
/opt/homebrew/Cellar/python@3.14/3.14.7/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions/3.14/bin/python3.14 -I /Users/kjopek/Workspace/safe-bash/tests/integration/git-public-independent-20260829/successor-bindings-v2/launch.py --run ROOT_AUTHORIZATION.json
```

The source-only assembly has no activation effect. Final publication/census is
recorded in PREPARATION-RECEIPT.json and its external publication receipt.

